# Copy to .env. Each setting is explained in doc/operating.md#settings; the Settings page can change most.
# A commented line is off. Under Compose nothing here is required. Without an Etherscan key, Linked wallets
# and Money loops back report themselves not run, unless a stored money trail feeds them.

# Postgres for the washtrace schema. Required outside Compose; DATABASE_URL is read if unset.
# WASHTRACE_STORE_URL=postgres://user:password@localhost:5432/washtrace

# JSON-RPC URL per chain, WASHTRACE_RPC_<chainId>.
WASHTRACE_RPC_1=
# WASHTRACE_RPC_8453=

# Etherscan API V2 key, one for every chain.
WASHTRACE_ETHERSCAN_KEY=
# Etherscan calls a second. Default 4.
# WASHTRACE_ETHERSCAN_RPS=
# Any API that answers Etherscan's account actions, such as Blockscout.
# WASHTRACE_ETHERSCAN_URL=

# Basic auth over every route but /api/health. Set both or neither.
# WASHTRACE_USERNAME=
# WASHTRACE_PASSWORD=

# Wallets of money followed out of a trader. Default 3, at most 10.
# WASHTRACE_FOLLOW_HOPS=
# Read a trader's money again when it trades, at most once every N days. Default 0, off.
# WASHTRACE_FOLLOW_REREAD=
# on: also read the tokens of wallets traders paid in tokens.
# WASHTRACE_TOKENS_PAYEES=

# The Hugging Face dataset (owner/name) stored data is downloaded from.
# WASHTRACE_STORED_REPO=
# Where the worker keeps stored data. Default data/stored.
# WASHTRACE_STORED_DIR=

# The port Compose publishes the console and API on, on 127.0.0.1. Default 8080.
# WASHTRACE_PORT=
# The worker's health check port. Default 8081.
# WASHTRACE_WORKER_PORT=

# Hugging Face token that can write to the dataset; only `npm run publish:hub` reads it.
# HF_TOKEN=
